WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.640
Jeremy sat near the pond.

2
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.420
He kicked his feet in the water.

3
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.580
"Ribby is mad at me," he thought.

4
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.760
"I must do something."

5
00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.740
Jeremy saw some yellow flowers.

6
00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:42.870
"I will bring her those flowers!" he thought.

7
00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:50.730
Jeremy picked the flowers.

8
00:00:51.521 --> 00:00:54.709
They smelled nice.

9
00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:58.350
"Ribby will love these flowers!" he thought.

10
00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.870
Jeremy found Ribby's house.

11
00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:40.370
He knocked on the door.

12
00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:44.580
Ribby looked surprised.

13
00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.480
"Oh. Hello," she said.

14
00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.460
Jeremy gave her the flowers.

15
00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.780
"I'm sorry I was rude to your friend."

16
00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.140
Ribby took the flowers.

17
00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.080
"How nice of you," she said.

18
00:02:00.233 --> 00:02:04.733
"They are beautiful, but—"

19
00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:08.614
Suddenly Ribby's nose twitched.

20
00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:10.800
Her eyes dripped.

21
00:02:11.902 --> 00:02:14.668
Ah-choo! Ah-choo!

22
00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.200
She began sneezing loudly.

23
00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:24.970
"I'm sorry, Jeremy," Ribby said.

24
00:02:25.362 --> 00:02:28.746
"But these yellow flowers make me sneeze!"

25
00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.940
She sneezed again.

26
00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:38.160
Finally Ribby ran outside.

27
00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.360
She ran to the pond.

28
00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:43.040
Ribby stood at the edge of the water.

29
00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.820
She got ready to throw the flowers.

30
00:02:45.928 --> 00:02:48.449
Then—AH-CHOO!

31
00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:50.600
She fell into the pond!
